    <briefdescription>
<para>Special <ref refid="structllvm_1_1_dense_map_info" kindref="compound">DenseMapInfo</ref> traits to compare MachineInstr* by <emphasis>value</emphasis> of the instruction rather than by pointer value. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The hashing and equality testing functions ignore definitions so this is useful for CSE, etc. </para>
